+## Current native deliverable — 2026-10-25
+
+The active native family is `stack_order=top_to_bottom|bottom_to_top` under
+`workspace/parametric/`. `top_to_bottom` is the exact canonical Racket source;
+the alternate reverses only complete two-row strips after canonical marker
+detection and extraction. It supports 2–6 demonstrations and exactly four
+setting-independent queries. The final query is a dense 30×30 canonical-domain
+case with four marker pairs, seven-cell interiors, and marker contact on all four
+canvas boundaries.
