+production generator: canonical/base Racket sources are compared under their
+whitespace-normalized authority contract, and temporary module-path helpers now
+restore the exact prior `sys.path`. The full portable target suite passes 103
+tests plus 32 subtests. Status is reviewer-ready; owner exact-source acceptance
